0.118 0.161 0.231 rg
56.6929133858267775 330.225236220472425 Td
(The asset permission engine evaluates permissions recursively from child to parent:) Tj
T* (1. Explicit Machine Check: asset_mac_${id} or asset_dev_${deviceId} -> if explicit canView is defined, it takes immediate) Tj
T* (precedence.) Tj
T* (2. Parent Facility Check: If machine has no explicit rule, inherits from asset_fac_${facilityId}.) Tj
T* (3. Parent Main Facility Check: If facility has no explicit rule, inherits from asset_mf_${mainFacilityId}.) Tj
T* (4. Global Asset Root Check: Inherits from root "assets" permission if defined; otherwise defaults to denied.) Tj
T* (This guarantees that users granted access to only a specific machine or facility cannot see or tamper with sibling assets.) Tj
